### jwks
GET /keys
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"keys":[{"use":"sig","kty":"RSA","kid":"{kid}","alg":"RS256","n":"{modulus}","e":"AQAB"}]}


### token client_credentials
POST /oauth/token
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"access_token":"{jwt}","token_type":"Bearer","expires_in":0}


### token wrong secret
POST /oauth/token
401 Unauthorized
Content-Type: application/json

{"error":"invalid_client"}


### token unsupported grant
POST /oauth/token
400 Bad Request
Content-Type: application/json

{"error":"unsupported_grant_type","error_description":"password not supported"}


### authorize
GET /authorize?client_id=golden-app&code_challenge=taakmHibHQFuJnBnpc6t832T9PQkRt80ju1v23Q-YPU&code_challenge_method=S256&nonce=n0nce&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A9999%2Fcallback&response_type=code&scope=openid+profile+email+offline_access&state=st4te
302 Found
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
Location: /login?auth_request={random}
Set-Cookie: registre_flow_{digest}={value}; Path=/; Max-Age=600; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax

<a href="/login?auth_request={random}">Found</a>.



### login
POST /api/login
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json
Set-Cookie: registre_account={value}; Path=/; Max-Age=43200; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax

{"redirect":"/authorize/callback?id={random}"}


### authorize callback
GET /authorize/callback?id={random}
302 Found
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
Location: http://127.0.0.1:9999/callback?code={random}&iss={issuer}&state=st4te
Set-Cookie: registre_flow_{digest}={value}; Path=/; Max-Age=0; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax

<a href="http://127.0.0.1:9999/callback?code={random}&amp;state=st4te">Found</a>.



### token authorization_code
POST /oauth/token
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"access_token":"{jwt}","token_type":"Bearer","refresh_token":"{refresh_token}","expires_in":0,"id_token":"{jwt}","scope":"openid profile email offline_access"}


### token refresh_token
POST /oauth/token
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"access_token":"{jwt}","token_type":"Bearer","refresh_token":"{refresh_token}","expires_in":0,"id_token":"{jwt}","scope":"openid profile email offline_access"}


### userinfo
GET /userinfo
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"sub":"{user}","name":"Golden Person","picture":"{issuer}/avatars/{user}","locale":"en","email":"golden@facile.studio","email_verified":true}


### userinfo without token
GET /userinfo
401 Unauthorized
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

access token invalid


### userinfo bad token
GET /userinfo
401 Unauthorized
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

access token invalid


### introspect
POST /oauth/introspect
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"active":true,"scope":"openid profile email offline_access","client_id":"golden-app","token_type":"Bearer","exp":0,"iat":0,"sub":"{user}","aud":["golden-app"],"iss":"{issuer}","jti":"{jti}"}


### introspect unknown token
POST /oauth/introspect
200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"active":false}


### introspect without client
POST /oauth/introspect
401 Unauthorized
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

ErrorType=invalid_client Parent=client_id missing from request


